<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Berry Busan - Strawberry Picking Guide</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS for styling -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-pink-50 text-gray-800">

    <!-- Main Container (Mobile First, centered on larger screens) -->
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto bg-white min-h-screen shadow-xl sm:my-8 sm:rounded-2xl sm:min-h-0 overflow-hidden relative">

        <!-- Top Image Placeholder -->
        <!-- You can replace the background-color or add an <img> tag inside here later -->
        <div class="w-full h-64 bg-gray-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-gray-400 relative">
            <img src="site.jpg" class="w-full h-64 object-cover" alt="Farm View">
        </div>

        <!-- Header Title -->
        <div class="px-6 pt-6 pb-2 text-center">
            <span class="bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wide">Welcome</span>
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-3 leading-tight">
                Berry Busan<br>
                <span class="text-red-500">Strawberry Picking</span><br>
                Quick Guide
            </h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Content Sections -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-8">

            <!-- 1. Location -->
            <section>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-red-500">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-lg"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">1. Location</h2>
                </div>
                
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                        Search for <strong>Seomyeon Seongwon Parking Lot</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3 bg-white p-2 rounded border border-gray-200">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot mt-1 text-red-400"></i>
                        <span>25 Bujeon-ro 140beon-gil, Busanjin-gu</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                        After passing the parking gate, enter the <strong>alley to your left</strong> (look for the bulletin board). The venue is located in the 3-story building inside that alley.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- 2. Inside the Farm -->
            <section>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-600">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-lg"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">2. Inside the Farm</h2>
                </div>

                <!-- Safety Card -->
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hard-hat text-yellow-500"></i> Safety First
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2 list-disc list-outside pl-4">
                        <li>The Smart Farm floor has rails. <strong>Please do not run or walk backward</strong>, as you may trip and fall.</li>
                        <li>Many parts of the facility have sharp edges.</li>
                        <li>To avoid injury, please <strong>only touch the strawberries</strong> and avoid touching equipment.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Bees Card -->
                <div class="bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-yellow-100">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-yellow-800 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bug"></i> Pollinating Bees
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-2">
                        There are bees flying around. Although they are large, they are attracted to flowers, not people.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white/60 p-2 rounded text-sm text-yellow-900 font-medium">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mt-1"></i>
                        <p>If a bee comes near, stay still and it will not sting. Never swing your arms or shrink away suddenly.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- 3. Picking Strawberry -->
            <section>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-red-500">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-scissors text-lg"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">3. Picking Strawberries</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
                    <div class="mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">
                            Strawberries are delicate. Once touched, they can bruise or develop mold.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-500">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-point-up"></i> Please Do not touch the fruit with your hands if you do not want to pick it.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2">How to pick:</h4>
                        <ul class="space-y-2">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <span><strong>Check ripeness:</strong> The redder the strawberry, the riper and tastier it is.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-red-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <span><strong>Caution:</strong> Be careful not to cut unripened (green) strawberries growing next to the ripe ones.</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- 4. Eating -->
            <section>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-500">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-faucet-drip text-lg"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">4. Eating</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-xl text-center border border-blue-100">
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-900 mb-2">
                        While our Smart Farm is clean, dust and residue may still remain.
                    </p>
                    <p class="font-bold text-blue-700 flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hands-bubbles"></i>
                        For your safety, please wash the strawberries before eating.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 text-center py-6 px-6 text-sm">
            <p class="mb-2">Have a sweet time at Berry Busan!</p>
            <p class="text-xs opacity-50">&copy; Berry Busan Smart Farm</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
